qtfoBJ2NHeZGmKEG7K9-wr3KTPWvwExPzbPl8rElOHY2eNH2iou0cL4I07VG4s0yw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8gz8yOjS6NOUGJ4SDCzSGhDJ56Ys7ikox1FuwVrLC31Q&oe=6A3AA553"}, {"file_name": "screenshot5.png", "id": "257663129204712", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75422370_257663132538045_3715272386866238300_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KkVncA4OON8Q7kNvwFi2lAb&_nc_oc=AdqzU5aKskUg2p3YLJVxjZOo9FlpZHTMOk7R61buDCoA9kbe7A8NgULb1K9UmB9VhxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9D1BXfautxa-fM_OBUctbrmjukKVsv7s2-daRXtwA8UA&oe=6A3A834A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "FigureOut VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Use the given Figures to fill the empty Fields . Use the Touch Controllers or the Game Menu to control the music. \nFull Room-Scale with different zoom stages.\nJust fill all the empty wood blocks with the given figures to advance to the next level.\n\nPlease copy your music files by making a new folder called figureout inside the music folder.\n\nFeatures: \n- 100 Levels\n- Easy to pickup\n- Use your own Music\n- Full Oculus Touch controller support\n- Dark and light background to choose from (B/Y Button)\n- Different scale sizes\n- Two different difficulties\n\nController Mapping:\nA/X Button: Open menu\nB/Y Button: Dark/Light Background\nUse both Grab Buttons to control the camera\nBoth Joysticks:\nUp/Down: Scale scene\nPress: Play/Stop Song\nRight/Left: Next/Previous Song\nPress both Trigger Buttons when a level is solved to quickly advance to the next level", "short_description": "Relaxing little Puzzle Game. Use the given Figures to fill the empty Fields and listen to your Music."}]}, "developer_name": "Daniel Ali", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.privacypolicies.com/live/04e10ea4-a388-4539-a810-86f7c0a95368", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Daniel Ali", "support_website_url": n